@startuml Domain-Model
' =====================================================================
' NFHotel 2.0 — Domain model
' Generated 2026-09-08 from src/NFHotel.Domain/
'
' The business concepts. No technology: no repositories, no DTOs,
' no methods that exist only for the sake of the implementation.
' =====================================================================

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 6

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2F4739
  ArrowColor #2F4739
  FontColor #1C1F1D
  AttributeFontColor #5A615C
  StereotypeFontColor #8A6A34
}
skinparam enum {
  BackgroundColor #F7F5F0
  BorderColor #B08A4F
  FontColor #1C1F1D
  AttributeFontColor #5A615C
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F7F5F0
  BorderColor #DDD9D0
  FontColor #5A615C
}

hide methods
hide circle

title NFHotel 2.0 — Domain model

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' Concepts
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------

class Booking {
  Booking number
  Arrival date
  Departure date
  Actual check-out date
  Check-in time
  Check-out time
  Number of nights
  Effective end date
}

class Room {
  Room number
  Floor
  Capacity
}

class Guest {
  First name
  Last name
  Email
  Phone number
  Country
  Passport number
}

class DateRange <<value object>> {
  Start
  End
  Number of nights
}

enum BookingStatus {
  Pending
  Confirmed
  Checked in
  Checked out
  Cancelled
}

enum RoomStatus <<bookability>> {
  Available
  Out of service
  Maintenance
}

enum HousekeepingStatus <<cleaning state>> {
  Clean
  Daily cleaning due
  Departure cleaning due
  Cleaning in progress
  Service requested
  Service in progress
}

enum RoomSize {
  Single
  Double
  Suite
}

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' Relations
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------

Guest "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes >
Room  "1" -- "0..*" Booking : is let through >

Booking ..> DateRange : period
Booking --> BookingStatus : status
Room --> RoomStatus : bookability
Room --> HousekeepingStatus : cleaning state
Room --> RoomSize : type

' ---------------------------------------------------------------------
' Business rules
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------

note bottom of Booking
  **The period is half-open.**
  A guest leaving on the 5th and one arriving
  on the 5th do not share the room.

  **Effective end date** is normally the departure
  date, but on early check-out it is the actual
  check-out date — so the room is released.

  **Cancelling does not delete.** The booking
  stays, with status Cancelled.
end note

note bottom of Room
  **Bookability and cleaning state are separate.**
  A room can be available for letting
  and at the same time need cleaning.

  The old system had one field for both —
  and it disagreed with its own user interface.
end note

note as N1
  **Deliberately not modelled**
  --
  **Price** — there is no price model.
  RoomSize is a category, not a rate.
  Without a price, revenue cannot be computed.

  **User and role** — authentication is deferred.
  Today the system does not know who is acting.

  **Payment and invoice** — follow from the price.

  **Extra services** — proposed, not decided.
end note

@enduml
